"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{AngryB}We found the photos of you and Lily."
},
{
"k": "21337",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[crying] {WorriedA}I know, I know, but that's-- that was-- I just..."
},
{
"k": "21338",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[sniffling] {SadA}I just love you, Snow. I love you, I love you, and-- {SuspiciousA}and I'm sorry I'm not Prince Charming, okay!"
},
{
"k": "21339",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{AngryB}I'm sorry I didn't cheat on you and run away to Europe!"
},
{
"k": "21340",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[ICE cold] {AngryC}You don't love me, Crane.[beat] {AngryB}I know what this is. I've seen it before."
},
{
"k": "21341",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[cold] It is not love."
},
{
"k": "21342",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[cold] Actually, what am I saying? I'm not sorry at all."
},
{
"k": "21343",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{WorriedA}Bigby, Sheriff, listen--"
},
{
"k": "21344",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "The amount of evidence I have... the town wouldn't bat an eye if I were to throw you down the Witching Well tonight."
},
{
"k": "21345",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[cold] You screwed up, Crane."
},
{
"k": "21346",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[pathetic] {SadA}Please, Sheriff, I'm telling you the truth when I say that I did not kill that woman."
},
{
"k": "21347",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[quiet] {WorriedA}Not always."
},
{
"k": "21348",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "What happened to you?[beat] Were you always like this?"
},
{
"k": "21349",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[quiet] It started as most things do: {ConfusedA}very, very small. Nothing more than a thought."
},
{
"k": "21350",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[pathetic] {WorriedA}But I didn't kill that woman."
},
{
"k": "21351",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "They'd throw a fuckin' parade."
},
{
"k": "21352",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[ligh shock] {ConfusedB}What?"
},
{
"k": "21353",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "Look at him.[beat] {ThinkingA}Do you really think this man murdered these women?"
},
{
"k": "21354",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[quietly]{SadA} Bigby..."
},
{
"k": "21355",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "He didn't do it."
},
{
"k": "21356",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{angryB}Don't talk to me."
},
{
"k": "21357",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[angry] {AngryA}Shut up."
},
{
"k": "21358",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[quietly] {WorriedA}Okay, okay."
},
{
"k": "21359",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{ThinkingC}He's not.... {ThinkingA}he wouldn't be brave enough..."
},
{
"k": "21360",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[pathetic and tired] {WorriedA}Thank you, my dear, {HappyA}it means so much to--[gets cut off]"
},
{
"k": "21361",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[cold] {AngryA}There's a lot we all have to answer for."
},
{
"k": "21362",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "This is different, Snow, and you know it."
},
{
"k": "21363",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "Snow, of course he's guilty."
},
{
"k": "21364",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "I mean, even if he didn't... say, kill Faith...there's still a lot for him to answer for."
},
{
"k": "21365",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "What do you mean? You don't think he did it at all?"
},
{
"k": "21366",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "[sighs] Maybe he didn't."
},
{
"k": "21367",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_puddingandpie",
"en": "{ConfusedA}Why would he even come here if he wasn't {SuspiciousA}covering his tracks?"
}
]